    "mu42w3cxducrvbya1": {
      "benefits": "Zero-touch: no new agents, no server credentials, no downtime.\nNear real-time and repeatable, not a one-off manual audit.\nFoundation for downstream work: end-of-life version tracking, patch-compliance reporting, upgrade planning.",
